#usda 1.0
(
    """
    This museum case exercises instances whose instanceable opinion is
    overridden to false, so that overrides on their descendants apply.

    In each case, X inherits L from within I, which references model.usda
    and is marked instanceable in asm.usda.  The implied inherit of L
    beneath X requires an ancestral index for I that skips the arc
    carrying X's opinions as a duplicate.  When that arc also carries the
    instanceable = false opinion on I, the ancestral index alone would
    find I to be an instance, and the opinions about L that should apply
    to X (a = 3) would be ignored.

    /RootLayerStack: I is deinstanced by light.usda, which X's opinions
    come from.  The ancestral index for I is in the root layer stack.

    /Nested: as /RootLayerStack, but inside inner.usda, reached by a
    subroot reference to X.  The ancestral index for I is in inner.usda's
    layer stack.

    /NestedPayload: as /Nested, but the instanceable = false opinion
    comes from a payload on I in light_payload.usda.  Because the payload
    is ancestral to the subroot reference, it is always included.

    The remaining cases deinstance I from outside the layer stack that
    instances it, so the ancestral index for I in that layer stack
    correctly finds I to be an instance, and the opinions about L reach X
    through the deinstancing layer stack:

    /DeinstancedHere: deinstances I in this layer stack.

    /DeinstancedInstance: references I itself and is not instanceable.

    viaMid.usda has a further case of this kind, in which mid.usda
    deinstances I.
    """
)

def "RootLayerStack" (
    references = [@./light.usda@</Light>, @./asm.usda@</Asm>]
)
{
    over "I"
    {
        over "rig"
        {
            over "lights"
            {
                over "L"
                {
                    double a = 3
                }
            }
        }
    }
}

def "Nested" (
    references = @./inner.usda@</Inner/I/rig/propagated/X>
)
{
}

def "NestedPayload" (
    references = @./inner_payload.usda@</Inner/I/rig/propagated/X>
)
{
}

def "DeinstancedHere" (
    references = @./inner_plain.usda@</Inner>
)
{
    over "I" (
        instanceable = false
    )
    {
    }
}

def "DeinstancedInstance" (
    instanceable = false
    references = @./inner_plain.usda@</Inner/I>
)
{
}
